[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_FF_TRADITIONAL]
Las Pegasus Military Co., Ltd.

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_FF_TRADITIONAL_desc]
There are over 550 million non-magical weapons in worldwide circulation. That’s one weapon for every 12 ponies in Equestria. The only question is, how do we arm the other 11?

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_FF_TRADITIONAL]
洛马基军事有限公司

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPMIG_FF_TRADITIONAL_desc]
全世界一共有5亿5千万件非魔法武器流通。也就是平均每12只小马就有1只持有武器。唯一的问题是，如何让另外11只小马也买武器？

